exists subj name outside obj num 0 be number ya
exists subj name switches obj ve bool truth lie truth be vector ya

subj name flip index to name bucket fromindex num 0 be ceremony def
obj name switches at num of fromindex of this be invert do
subj name flip index be ceremony prah

# Loop fromindex counts down each pass; start at 2 for a 3-element vector so we hit indices 2,1,0.
to name outside fromindex num 2 toindex num -1 be flip index do

obj name outside be say do
obj name switches be say do
